{
  "description": "A single quadrupedal mammal is shown in right-facing profile against a plain light background, standing with its body arched and its long tapering tail extending to the rear. The animal has an elongated narrow snout with a dark nostril at the tip, a small dark eye, and a low, robust body supported by four short sturdy limbs ending in large curved claws. Most of the dorsal surface, head top, outer limbs and tail are covered in overlapping dark brown to grayish keratinous scales with lighter edges, arranged like shingles. Large irregular patches of pale pink, wrinkled bare skin are visible on the mid-back, mid-flank, and rear flank where scales are absent, as well as paler skin on the underside and lower limbs. The texture of scales, skin, and claws is rendered in fine detail, with dirt around the feet.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated and narrow with a pointed snout, a dark nostril at the tip, a small round dark eye with fine wrinkles around it, and short whiskers near the mouth; the top of the head and snout are covered in small overlapping scales",
      "where": "at the front right of the body, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "one small rounded ear with a visible inner fold and a fringe of fine pale hairs around the rim, with textured gray-brown skin",
      "where": "on the side of the head behind and slightly above the eye"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four short, thick, muscular limbs with pale wrinkled skin on the lower portions and overlapping dark scales on the upper and outer portions",
      "where": "beneath the body, two forelimbs under the chest and two hindlimbs under the rear, supporting the body in a standing posture"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four broad feet with thick toes bearing long, dark, strongly curved claws, three to four claws visible per foot, with granular skin and specks of dark dirt around the claws and soles",
      "where": "at the distal ends of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick at the base and tapering to a pointed tip, covered dorsally with overlapping dark scales and with a ridged, paler underside",
      "where": "extending from the rear of the body to the right, lying along the ground behind the hind feet"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "numerous overlapping, rounded to pointed keratinous plates, dark brown to gray with lighter tan edges and fine radiating striations, layered densely like shingles",
      "where": "covering most of the back, sides, top of the head, outer surfaces of the limbs, and the dorsal surface of the tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "large irregular patches of exposed pale pink skin with soft wrinkles and folds, contrasting sharply with the surrounding dark scales",
      "where": "on the mid-back forming a large dorsal patch, on the mid-flank below it, and on the rear flank and hip area"
    }
  ],
